{"seq":7,"slug":"lc0188-best-time-to-buy-sell-stock-iv","title":"LeetCode 188 买卖股票的最佳时机 IV","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-dp-advanced/lc0188-best-time-to-buy-sell-stock-iv","wordCount":681,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-188-买卖股票的最佳时机-iv\">LeetCode 188 买卖股票的最佳时机 IV</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个整数数组 <code>prices</code>，其中 <code>prices[i]</code> 是某支股票第 <code>i</code> 天的价格。设计一个算法来计算你所能获取的<strong>最大利润</strong>。你最多可以完成 <code>k</code> 笔交易。</p>\n<p>注意：你不能同时参与多笔交易（必须在再次购买前出售掉之前的股票）。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= k &lt;= 100</code></li>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= prices.length &lt;= 1000</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= prices[i] &lt;= 1000</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：k = 2, prices = [2,4,1]&#10;输出：2&#10;解释：第 1 天买入（价格 2），第 2 天卖出（价格 4），利润 2。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：k = 2, prices = [2,4,1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：第 1 天买入（价格 2），第 2 天卖出（价格 4），利润 2。</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：k = 2, prices = [3,2,6,5,0,3]&#10;输出：7&#10;解释：第 2 天买入（价格 2），第 3 天卖出（价格 6），利润 4。&#10;     第 5 天买入（价格 0），第 6 天卖出（价格 3），利润 3。总利润 7。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：k = 2, prices = [3,2,6,5,0,3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：第 2 天买入（价格 2），第 3 天卖出（价格 6），利润 4。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     第 5 天买入（价格 0），第 6 天卖出（价格 3），利润 3。总利润 7。</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题是 LC #123（最多 2 次交易）的通用化版本。将固定的 2 次交易扩展为 k 次。</p>\n<p><strong>状态定义：</strong> <code>dp[j][0]</code> 表示完成了 <code>j</code> 笔交易后不持有股票的最大利润，<code>dp[j][1]</code> 表示完成了 <code>j-1</code> 笔交易后持有股票的最大利润。</p>\n<p>或者更直观地：用 <code>buy[j]</code> 和 <code>sell[j]</code> 分别表示第 <code>j</code> 次买入和第 <code>j</code> 次卖出后的最大利润。</p>\n<p><strong>关键优化：</strong> 当 <code>k &gt;= n/2</code> 时（n 为天数），交易次数不构成限制，问题退化为&quot;无限次交易&quot;（LC #122），可以用贪心解决。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;k 次交易 DP&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B{&quot;k &gt;= n/2?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[退化为无限次交易]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[贪心: 收集所有正差]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[状态机 DP]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[维护 buy[1..k] 和 sell[1..k]&quot;]&#10;    D1 --&gt; D2[&quot;每天更新所有状态&quot;]&#10;    D2 --&gt; D3[返回 sell[k]&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"k 次交易 DP\"]\n    A --&gt; B{\"k &gt;= n/2?\"}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[退化为无限次交易]\n    C --&gt; C1[贪心: 收集所有正差]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[状态机 DP]\n    D --&gt; D1[维护 buy[1..k] 和 sell[1..k]\"]\n    D1 --&gt; D2[\"每天更新所有状态\"]\n    D2 --&gt; D3[返回 sell[k]\"]</pre><p><strong>状态转移方程（对每一天）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"buy[j]  = max(buy[j], sell[j-1] - price)    对 j = 1, 2, ..., k&#10;sell[j] = max(sell[j], buy[j] + price)       对 j = 1, 2, ..., k\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>buy[j]  = max(buy[j], sell[j-1] - price)    对 j = 1, 2, ..., k</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sell[j] = max(sell[j], buy[j] + price)       对 j = 1, 2, ..., k</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态机 DP</td>\n<td>O(n × k)</td>\n<td>O(k)</td>\n<td>k 较小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贪心（k 大时）</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>k &gt;= n/2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并策略</td>\n<td>O(n × min(k, n/2))</td>\n<td>O(min(k, n/2))</td>\n<td>最优综合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>通用 k 次交易状态机 DP：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function maxProfit(k: number, prices: number[]): number {&#10;  const n = prices.length;&#10;&#10;  if (k &gt;= Math.floor(n / 2)) {&#10;    let profit = 0;&#10;    for (let i = 1; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;      if (prices[i] &gt; prices[i - 1]) {&#10;        profit += prices[i] - prices[i - 1];&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;    return profit;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const buy = new Array(k + 1).fill(-Infinity);&#10;  const sell = new Array(k + 1).fill(0);&#10;&#10;  for (const price of prices) {&#10;    for (let j = 1; j &lt;= k; j++) {&#10;      buy[j] = Math.max(buy[j], sell[j - 1] - price);&#10;      sell[j] = Math.max(sell[j], buy[j] + price);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return sell[k];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maxProfit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">prices</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prices.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> profit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (prices[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prices[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        profit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prices[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prices[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> profit;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> buy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Infinity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sell</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> price</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prices) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k; j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      buy[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(buy[j], sell[j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      sell[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sell[j], buy[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sell[k];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>二维 DP（完整版，便于理解）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function maxProfitFull(k: number, prices: number[]): number {&#10;  const n = prices.length;&#10;  if (n === 0) return 0;&#10;&#10;  if (k &gt;= Math.floor(n / 2)) {&#10;    let profit = 0;&#10;    for (let i = 1; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;      if (prices[i] &gt; prices[i - 1]) {&#10;        profit += prices[i] - prices[i - 1];&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;    return profit;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const dp: number[][] = Array.from({ length: k + 1 }, () =&gt; new Array(n).fill(0));&#10;&#10;  for (let j = 1; j &lt;= k; j++) {&#10;    let maxDiff = -prices[0];&#10;    for (let i = 1; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;      dp[j][i] = Math.max(dp[j][i - 1], prices[i] + maxDiff);&#10;      maxDiff = Math.max(maxDiff, dp[j - 1][i] - prices[i]);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dp[k][n - 1];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maxProfitFull</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">prices</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-